HostKubernetes <ol> <li> <p>Create <code>/etc/ella-mocn.nft</code>, with the interface radios' user traffic arrives on, <code>eth1</code> here:</p> <pre><code>table inet ella-mocn
delete table inet ella-mocn

table inet ella-mocn {
    chain forward {
        type filter hook forward priority filter; policy accept;
        iifname "eth1" drop
        oifname "eth1" drop
        iifname "xfrm-*" oifname "xfrm-*" drop
    }
}
</code></pre> </li> <li> <p>Load it at every boot:</p> <pre><code>echo 'include "/etc/ella-mocn.nft"' | sudo tee -a /etc/nftables.conf
sudo systemctl enable nftables
</code></pre> </li> <li> <p>Load it now:</p> <pre><code>sudo nft -f /etc/ella-mocn.nft
</code></pre> </li> </ol> <p>Allow privileged pods in Ella MOCN's namespace:</p> <pre><code>kubectl label namespace ella pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=privileged pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn=privileged --overwrite
</code></pre>
